P=[
('虽然……但是……','suīrán … dànshì …','although … (but) …',r'虽然[^。！？]*?(但是|可是|但|却|还是)','Put 虽然 in the first half and 但是 / 可是 in the second. English uses only "although", but Chinese likes both words.','虽然 + fact，但是 + surprising result','虽然下雨，但是我们还是去踢球了。','Don\'t drop 但是 — examiners like seeing the full pair.'),
('因为……所以……','yīnwèi … suǒyǐ …','because … so …',r'因为[^。！？]*?所以','Reason first with 因为, result second with 所以. You can also use just one of them.','因为 + reason，所以 + result','因为我很累，所以我早点睡觉了。','In Chinese the reason usually comes first.'),
('不但……而且……','búdàn … érqiě …','not only … but also …',r'不但[^。！？]*?(而且|还|也)','Adds a second, stronger point. Great for making answers longer.','A 不但 + point 1，而且 + point 2','这家餐厅不但便宜，而且很好吃。','If both halves share a subject, put it before 不但.'),
('又……又……','yòu … yòu …','both … and …',r'又[^又。！？，]{1,5}又','Joins two adjectives (or verbs) about the same thing.','subject + 又 + adj + 又 + adj','我的书包又大又重。','Both adjectives should be "the same direction" (both good or both bad) most of the time.'),
('既……又……','jì … yòu …','both … and … (more formal)',r'既[^。！？]*?又','Like 又…又… but slightly more formal; often used with verbs.','既能 + A，又能 + B','做运动既能健身，又能减压。','Good for higher-level writing.'),
('一……就……','yī … jiù …','as soon as … (then) …',r'一(?![直起样定共般切些点下边次天年个旦])[^。！？，]{0,6}就','Two actions straight after each other. 一 goes before the first verb, 就 before the second.','subject + 一 + action 1 + 就 + action 2','我一回家就做作业。','Both verbs need to be quick actions, e.g. 一到家就…'),
('越来越……','yuè lái yuè …','more and more …',r'越来越','Shows change over time. Put an adjective or feeling verb after it.','subject + 越来越 + adjective','我的中文越来越好了。','Don\'t put 很 after it: say 越来越好, not 越来越很好.'),
('越……越……','yuè … yuè …','the more … the more …',r'越[^来。！？，]{1,4}越','When one thing increases, so does another.','越 + verb 1 + 越 + adjective','他越想越难过。','Short and powerful for writing.'),
('A 比 B + adjective','A bǐ B …','A is more … than B',r'比[^。！？，]{1,8}(大|小|高|矮|快|慢|贵|便宜|多|少|好|漂亮|长|重|近|远|难|简单|健康|方便|有意思|好吃|软|早|晚|拥挤|容易|壮观)','Comparison. Never put 很 before the adjective — use 多了 or 一点儿 instead.','A 比 B + adj（+ 多了 / 一点儿 / 两岁）','坐地铁比坐公共汽车快多了。','比 sentences never take 很: ✗ 他比我很高。'),
('A 没有 B 那么 + adjective','A méiyǒu B nàme …','A is not as … as B',r'没有(?![^。！？，]*见)[^。！？，]{1,8}(那么|这么)','The negative of 比.','A 没有 B (那么) + adj','这家餐馆的菜没有那家好吃。','You can leave out 那么.'),
('除了……以外，还/也……','chúle … yǐwài, hái/yě …','apart from / besides …',r'除了[^。！？]*?(还|也|都)','With 还/也 it means "as well as"; with 都 it means "except".','除了 A 以外，我还 + B','除了中文以外，我还学法语。','除了…都… = everyone except. 除了…还… = in addition.'),
('把 sentence','bǎ','do something to an object',r'把[^。！？，]{1,10}(了|完|好|开|进|到|在|给|成|起来|吓)','Moves the object before the verb to show what happened to it. The verb needs something after it (了, 完, 到…).','subject + 把 + object + verb + result','我把作业做完了。','✗ 我把作业做。 The verb can\'t stand alone.'),
('被 (passive)','bèi','be done by …',r'被(?!子)','Shows something was done to the subject, often something bad.','subject + 被 + (doer) + verb + 了','我的钱包被偷了。','Often used for unlucky events.'),
('verb + 得 + description','… de …','describes how well/how something is done',r'(?<![觉记值获懂晓舍使不])得(很|非常|太|特别|不|好|最|多|真|那么|更|快|慢|晚|早|不可开交)','Comments on how an action is done.','verb + 得 + 很 + adjective','她唱歌唱得很好。','If there is an object, repeat the verb: 唱歌唱得好.'),
('如果……就……','rúguǒ … jiù …','if … then …',r'如果[^。！？]*?就','Conditions. 就 goes before the verb in the second half.','如果 + condition，(subject) 就 + result','如果明天不下雨，我们就去爬山。','就 comes after the subject: 我们就去, not 就我们去.'),
('只要……就……','zhǐyào … jiù …','as long as …',r'只要[^。！？]*?就','One condition is enough.','只要 + condition，就 + result','只要努力，就能学好中文。','Use 只有…才… for "only if".'),
('无论/不管……都……','wúlùn / bùguǎn … dōu …','no matter …',r'(无论|不管)[^。！？]*?都','The result is always the same. Needs a question word or choice after 无论/不管.','不管 + 什么/怎么/A还是B，都 + result','不管天气怎么样，我都去跑步。','Follow 不管 with 什么/谁/怎么 or A 还是 B.'),
('不是……就是……','búshì … jiùshì …','either … or …',r'不是[^。！？]*?就是','It must be one of two things.','不是 + A，就是 + B','周末他不是看电视，就是玩游戏。','Great for describing habits.'),
('先……然后/再……','xiān … ránhòu/zài …','first … then …',r'先[^。！？]*?(然后|再)','Puts actions in order.','先 + action 1，然后 + action 2','我先洗澡，然后吃早饭。','Add 最后 for a third step.'),
('一边……一边……','yìbiān … yìbiān …','doing two things at once',r'(一)?边[^。！？，]{1,6}(一)?边','Two actions at the same time.','一边 + verb 1 + 一边 + verb 2','我们一边吃饭一边聊天。','In speech you can shorten it to 边…边….'),
('对……来说','duì … lái shuō','for … / as far as … is concerned',r'对(于)?[^。！？，]{1,8}来说','Gives the point of view of a person or group.','对 + person + 来说，……','对学生来说，考试很重要。','对于 is the more formal version.'),
('是……的','shì … de','stresses when/where/how something happened',r'是(在(?!说)|坐|从|和|跟|昨天|去年|上个|什么时候|怎么|哪)[^。！？，]{0,10}的','Used for past events to stress the time, place or way.','subject + 是 + time/place/way + verb + 的','我是坐飞机去的。','Only for things that have already happened.'),
('连……都/也……','lián … dōu/yě …','even …',r'连[^。！？]*?(都|也)','Shows something surprising or extreme.','连 + surprising thing + 都/也 + verb','他连早饭都没吃。','Often used with negatives.'),
('宁愿……也不……','nìngyuàn … yě bù …','would rather … than …',r'宁愿[^。！？]*?也','A strong preference.','宁愿 + A，也不 + B','我宁愿走路，也不坐那么挤的车。','Higher-level pattern; nice in opinion essays.'),
('与其……还不如……','yǔqí … hái bùrú …','rather than … it is better to …',r'与其[^。！？]*?不如','Says the second option is better.','与其 + A，还不如 + B','与其在家睡懒觉，还不如去做暑期工。','Advanced — impresses examiners.'),
('……之一','… zhī yī','one of the …',r'之一','Put after a group noun.','……是 + 最 + adj + 的 + noun + 之一','长城是中国最有名的景点之一。','The noun before 之一 is plural in meaning.'),
('有的……有的……','yǒude … yǒude …','some … others …',r'有的[^。！？]*?有的','Describes different groups.','有的人 + A，有的人 + B','有的人想去美国，有的人想去欧洲。','Can add 还有的 for a third group.'),
('为了……','wèile …','in order to …',r'为了','Gives the purpose. Usually at the start of the sentence.','为了 + goal，subject + action','为了身体健康，我每天运动。','Don\'t confuse with 因为 (because).'),
('……过 (experience)','… guo','have done (before)',r'[去吃做见看到听说用住学]过[^了]','Talks about experiences. Negative: 没(有)…过.','subject + verb + 过 + object','我去过中国，没去过日本。','Negative uses 没, not 不.'),
('太……了','tài … le','too / so …',r'太[^。！？，]{1,4}了','Strong feeling, good or bad.','太 + adjective + 了','这只小狗太可爱了！','Don\'t forget the 了.'),
('……才……','cái','not until … (later than expected)',r'(很晚|很久|十一点半?|半夜)才','才 means something happened later, or took longer, than expected. Its opposite is 就 (earlier/sooner).','time + 才 + verb','我十一点才睡觉，他六点就起床了。','才 sentences don\'t take 了.'),
('一点儿也/都 不……','yìdiǎnr yě/dōu bù …','not at all',r'一点(儿)?(也|都)(不|没)','Strong negative.','一点儿也不 + adjective/verb','这次考试一点儿也不难。','Works with 没 too: 一点儿也没吃.'),
]
